{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What if Victor Frankenstein had competition?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete to build the perfect monster - then unleash it to hunt your rival scientists.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/dd88403752c8bb8c5a5d1f0316a31cc0.avif?t=1761268777\" width=1508 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Working alongside</strong>\u00a0<strong>a monster</strong> from your collection, explore a huge hand-drawn map, <strong>swapping and raiding parts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by your hippocratic oath, anything you steal must have something left in its place, so use <strong>cunning tactics</strong>\u00a0to swap strategically, without leaving rivals something they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When time runs out, <strong>the scientific community will judge your new creations</strong>. The winner gets a boost to their reputation, unlocking intriguing abilities...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Shelley's creature (from the novel) is one of 13 voiced monsters you can <strong>build and collect </strong>in this spooky meta romp through mad science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- SINGLE PLAYER -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full game offline against bot scientists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/extras/c0edc0b5c6c1f6ebf846297b6028e3a4.avif?t=1761268777\" width=1560 height=898 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099970?t=1761268777","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099970/cc2216c36caaa2684430e3281145931bcce04efe/page_bg_raw